 "notes": "Conservative estimate (solid line) of the Solar Axion Basin limit from Figure 3 (plotgBasin.pdf). This is derived by recasting direct detection experimental results (XENON1T S2, LUX, PandaX-II) under the assumption of axion absorption from the Solar basin. The limit is based on gravitational ejection timescale estimate from Eq. 9 (most conservative estimate). Mass range covers 0.165-44.7 keV. The paper's coupling convention g_aee matches the canonical AxionBench definition g_ae = C_e m_e / f_a with L = g_ae (\u2202_\u03bc a / 2m_e) \u0113 \u03b3^\u03bc \u03b3_5 e (Eq. 17).",
